Z||000015||Joe Torma||08-25-2001||12:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierosound:<BR>[B] <BR>Pontiac Transport FWD 3400 roller-cam block, Fiero heads and top-end.  Looks stock, works great!!<BR>B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Decent setup, but lacks the GEN III head advantage--and 2.8 intake runners are a bit smaller than the 3400.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000016||lowCG||08-26-2001||02:06 AM||||I would also strongly advise the use of a stock clutch,not a stock clutch rebuilt with Kevlar lining,not guaranteed from the vendors that won't accept Visa/MC.<BR>Even in California.||||reg||1
